{"availability":"available","full":"puikinsh/Adminator-admin-dashboard","name":"Adminator-admin-dashboard","description":"Adminator is easy to use and well design admin dashboard template with dark mode for web apps, websites, services and more","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":4663,"forks":1749,"created":"2017-11-17T17:37:30Z","updated":"2026-09-29T21:24:51Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://adminator.colorlib.com/","topics":["admin-dashboard","admin-dashboard-ui","admin-panel","admin-template","admin-ui","bootstrap","bootstrap-5","bootstrap-5-admin-template","bootstrap-5-dashboard","bootstrap-5-template","bootstrap-dashboard","bootstrap-theme","bootstrap5","dashboard","dashboard-template","dashboards","free-admin-dashboard","free-admin-template","html","website-template"],"demo":"https://preview.colorlib.com/theme/adminator/index.html","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:49.427Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:49.427Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:49.427Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:05:49.427Z","stars":4663,"forks":1749}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( []( []( []( [](LICENSE) []( [](#tech-stack) [](#theming)","Adminator 4 is a vanilla-JS admin dashboard template with a token-driven CSS-variable design system, dark mode, and zero framework dependencies. No jQuery. No Bootstrap. Just clean HTML, modern CSS, and 700 KB of production JS for the entire 18-page template.","Heads up — v4.0.0 is a ground-up rewrite. New design system, new shell architecture, Bootstrap removed. If you prefer the previous design, the v3 codebase lives on the legacy-v3 branch and will continue to receive security updates."],"features":["Token-driven design system. All colors, typography, spacing, and shadows live in tokens.scss as CSS variables with light + dark variants. Edit one variable, every component updates.","Real dark mode. A single data-theme attribute on swaps the entire UI — including Chart.js, FullCalendar, and jsvectormap, which all re-render via a MutationObserver to read the new token values.","Zero framework CSS. No Bootstrap. No utility-class soup. Every UI primitive (buttons, dropdowns, alerts, badges, modals, tabs, accordions, switches, progress bars) is custom-built and theme-aware.","Single JS shell. Sidebar/topbar/footer render from a single NAV manifest in Shell.js. Pages declare and three placeholders. Add a nav item by editing one array.","Real, themed library integrations. Chart.js (6 chart types), FullCalendar (all four views, 24 seed events), jsvectormap (world map with 10 markers). All read CSS variables and re-render on theme toggle."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/puikinsh/Adminator-admin-dashboard/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"9d45e4d1ada79cc9f4583a4c641473d7c4f5ac45b764000f544aefe8e380e1b5","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:49.515Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:49.515Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( []( []( []( [](LICENSE) []( [](#tech-stack) [](#theming)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/puikinsh/Adminator-admin-dashboard/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"All 18 pages redesigned: Dashboard, Email, Calendar, Chat, Compose, Charts, Forms, UI Elements, Buttons, Basic Table, Data Table, Google Maps, Vector Maps, Blank, Sign In, Sign Up, 404, 500.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/puikinsh/Adminator-admin-dashboard/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"HTML5 & CSS3 Login Forms","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/puikinsh/Adminator-admin-dashboard/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"9d45e4d1ada79cc9f4583a4c641473d7c4f5ac45b764000f544aefe8e380e1b5","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/puikinsh/Adminator-admin-dashboard/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:49.515Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-29T21:24:51Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"s